{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":31,"ref":"judges 20:31","book":"judges","lang":"de","chapter":20,"translation":"Und die Söhne Binjamins zogen aus, dem Volk entgegen; sie rissen sich los von der Stadt und begannen, vom Volk Erschlagene ⟨niederzustrecken⟩, wie Mal zu Mal, auf den Straßen — die eine steigt hinauf nach Beit-El und die andere nach Giv'a, auf dem Feld —, etwa dreißig Mann in Jisra'el.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויצאו","gloss":"Und zogen aus"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"die Söhne"},{"surface":"בנימן","gloss":"Binjamins"},{"surface":"לקראת","gloss":"entgegen"},{"surface":"העם","gloss":"dem Volk"},{"surface":"הנתקו","gloss":"sie rissen sich los"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"von"},{"surface":"העיר","gloss":"der Stadt"},{"surface":"ויחלו","gloss":"und begannen"},{"surface":"להכות","gloss":"zu schlagen"},{"surface":"מהעם","gloss":"vom Volk"},{"surface":"חללים","gloss":"Erschlagene"},{"surface":"כפעם","gloss":"wie Mal"},{"surface":"בפעם","gloss":"zu Mal"},{"surface":"במסלות","gloss":"auf den Straßen"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"die"},{"surface":"אחת","gloss":"die eine"},{"surface":"עלה","gloss":"steigt hinauf"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"Beit"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"-El"},{"surface":"ואחת","gloss":"und die andere"},{"surface":"גבעתה","gloss":"nach Giv'a"},{"surface":"בשדה","gloss":"auf dem Feld"},{"surface":"כשלשים","gloss":"etwa dreißig"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"Mann"},{"surface":"בישראל","gloss":"in Jisra'el"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T21:06:07.475209299Z","model":"glm-5.2"}